	&LENNARD-JONES
	  ATOMS YA YA
	  EPSILON [kcalmol]   $YA_epsilon
	  SIGMA [angstrom]    $YA_sigma
	  RCUT  [angstrom]    $CUTOFF
	&END LENNARD-JONES

	&LENNARD-JONES
